# Testing

Follow the verification matrix in the root and nearest domain `AGENTS.md`.
Name tests after behavior, not implementation. Add the smallest regression
test that would fail without the change; use test-first development when the
task explicitly requests it or it clarifies a non-trivial behavior.

When a function signature changes, update every mock to match. Fix the code, not the test (unless the test is wrong).
